@host = http://localhost:5003
@studentEmail = teststudent@example.com
@studentPassword = Test@12345

### 1. Log in as the student
# @name studentLogin
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{studentEmail}}", "password": "{{studentPassword}}" }

### 2. Instant: gaps + suggested certifications for ONE internship (replace 1 with a real, open internship id)
GET {{host}}/api/students/skill-gaps?internshipId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{studentLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 3. Instant: gaps across the student's top 5 matches
GET {{host}}/api/students/skill-gaps
Authorization: Bearer {{studentLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 4. Background job: same result plus the AI summary and a reason per certification (202 + job id)
# @name gapJob
POST {{host}}/api/students/skill-gaps
Authorization: Bearer {{studentLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 5. Poll it until status is Done
GET {{host}}/api/ai-jobs/{{gapJob.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentLogin.response.body.$.token}}
